[283.946269, "o", "error: unknown command 'push'\r\n(Did you mean dash?)\r\n"]
[283.946313, "o", "\r\n"]
[283.947419, "o", "Usage: convex <command> [options]\r\n\r\nStart developing with Convex by running `npx convex dev`.\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  dev [options]                        Develop against a dev deployment,\r\n                                       watching for changes\r\n  deploy [options]                     Deploy to a production or preview\r\n                                       deployment\r\n  run [options] [functionName] [args]  Run a function or evaluate an inline\r\n                                       readonly query on your deployment\r\n  import [options] <path>              Import data from a file to your\r\n                                       deployment\r\n  dashboard|dash [options]             Open the dashboard in the browser\r\n  docs [options]                       Open the docs in the browser\r\n  logs [options]                       Watch logs from your deployment\r\n  export [options]                     Export data from your deployment to a ZIP\r\n                                       file\r\n  env [options]                        Set and view environment variables\r\n"]
[283.947446, "o", "  data [options] [table]               List tables and print data from your\r\n                                       database\r\n  deployment                           Manage deployments\r\n  project                              Manage projects\r\n  codegen [options]                    Generate backend type definitions\r\n  update                               Print instructions for updating the\r\n                                       convex package\r\n  logout                               Log out of Convex on this machine\r\n"]
[283.967937, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@7cfe4f15-f3a0-4c42-899e-b020d014dff8:/home/user/convex-search# "]
[368.764271, "i", "npx convex deploy --codegen 2>&1 | head -30\n"]
[368.764526, "o", "npx convex deploy --codegen 2>&1 | head -30\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[369.334046, "o", "error: option '--codegen <mode>' argument missing\r\n"]
[369.334147, "o", "\r\n"]
[369.335622, "o", "Usage: convex deploy [options]\r\n\r\nDeploys code to a deployment.\r\nThis is typically used for deploying to a prod or preview deployment manually or\r\nfrom CI; to deploy to your dev deployment when developing, use `npx convex dev`.\r\n\r\nThe target deployment is chosen like this:\r\n• If the `CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT` environment variable is set (typical during local\r\ndevelopment), the target is the project’s default production deployment.\r\n• If the `CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY` environment variable is set (typical in CI), it is\r\nthe deployment associated with that key.\r\n  • When it’s set to a preview deploy key, it will deploy to a preview\r\ndeployment:\r\n    • with the name of the current Git branch when running in CI (Vercel,\r\nNetlify, Cloudflare Pages, GitHub)\r\n    • or with the name specified by the `--preview-name` or `--preview-create`\r\nflags\r\n\r\n`npx convex deploy` will:\r\n  1. Run a command if specified with `--cmd`, with the deployment URL available\r\nas an environment variable.\r\n  2. Typecheck your Convex functions.\r\n  3. Regenerate the generated code in the `convex/_generated` directory.\r\n  4. Bundle your Convex functions and their dependencies.\r\n  5. Push your functions, indexes, and schema to the deployment.\r\n  6. When deploying to a preview deployment, it runs the function specified by\r\n`--preview-run`.\r\nIf any step fails, the next steps do not run.\r\n"]
[369.359258, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@7cfe4f15-f3a0-4c42-899e-b020d014dff8:/home/user/convex-search# "]
[401.422423, "i", "npx convex dev --once 2>&1 | head -40\n"]
[401.42272, "o", "npx convex dev --once 2>&1 | head -40\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[402.206412, "o", "✔ Provisioned a dev deployment and saved its:\r\n    client URL as CONVEX_URL\r\n    HTTP actions URL as CONVEX_SITE_URL\r\n to .env.local\r\n  Added \".env.local\" to .gitignore\r\n"]
[402.206525, "o", "\r\nWrite your Convex functions in convex/\r\nGive us feedback at https://convex.dev/community or support@convex.dev\r\nView the Convex dashboard at https://dashboard.convex.dev/d/disciplined-crane-731\r\n\r\n"]
